{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31321","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 二 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃蹊李径尽荒凉，访旧寻新益自伤。\n虽有衣衾藏李固，终无表疏雪王章。\n羁魂尚觉霜风冷，朽骨徒惊月桂香。\n天爵竟爲人爵悞，谁能高叫问苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}